OL,3,GNEWSADozens of migrants taken to Dover
OL,4,Aafter more than 30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of migrants who spent more than
OL,7,F30 hours at sea have been taken to
OL,8,FDover by water, the Conservative MP for
OL,9,FGosport has said.
OL,11,FIt comes after an earlier report that
OL,12,Fthe boat would be brought to Gosport,
OL,13,Fprompting a gathering of protesters in
OL,14,Fthe Hampshire town.
OL,16,FThe boat had left the Normandy coast on
OL,17,FMonday morning. The French coastguard,
OL,18,Fwho had shadowed the vessel, said about
OL,19,F60 migrants on the boat were in
OL,20,F"precarious conditions" and refused
OL,21,Fhelp as they were "determined to take
OL,22,Fall risks to reach" the UK.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
